You are an expert Python backend developer. I need you to build a complete 
production-ready backend for an AI-powered RFP Discovery system.

=============================================================
PROJECT OVERVIEW
=============================================================
Build a fully functional FastAPI backend for an automated RFP 
(Request for Proposal) Discovery system that:
- Crawls procurement portals for RFP opportunities
- Filters them through a rule engine
- Extracts structured intelligence using LLMs
- Routes output through a Human-in-the-Loop (HIL) validation gate
- Hands off confirmed outputs to downstream modules

=============================================================
TECH STACK
=============================================================
- Framework: FastAPI (async)
- Task Queue: Celery + Redis
- Database: PostgreSQL with SQLAlchemy ORM
- LLM Orchestration: LangChain + Anthropic Claude API
- Document Parsing: PyMuPDF, python-docx, BeautifulSoup4
- Web Crawling: Scrapy + Playwright
- Auth: OAuth2 + JWT (role-based)
- Notifications: MS Teams Webhook
- Schema Validation: Pydantic v2
- Migrations: Alembic
- Testing: Pytest

